= The Final Midterm Stretch

The 2026 midterm elections are ten months away. The next ten months will define how the story of this era ends.

- @final_all_in: All in on turnout
- @final_bridge: Broaden the coalition

@final_all_in
on-arrival: dem_enthusiasm += 0.6; civic_strength += 200; resources -= 0

We commit everything to the final push.

@final_bridge
on-arrival: suburban_dem += 2*(1-dissent); rural_dem += 2*(1-dissent); moderate_strength += 2; progressive_dissent += 2

We aim for persuasion over mobilization.
